{"n": 115, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "115.webp", "text": "11-7\n\nVacuum Advance Control ~ Since 1984 Models:\nThe vacuum advance control on the distributor\n3 operated by an alectric switching valve,\n(Conditions:\n\n— road speed abows 65 km/h (40 mph) or\n\n— 4th/Sth gear engaged\n\nChecking Fourth/Fifth Gear Switch / Switch:\ning Relay (3):\n\nEngine stopped — ignition on,\n\nThe fourth/filth gear switch is okay, if relay\n(3) switehes with engaged 4th/Sth gears —\ngreen/red wire produces positive pulses and\nbrown/red wire negative (ground) pulses,\n\n(Checking Speed Switch / Switching Relay (8):\n\nSimulate road speeds according to speedometer\n\n‘test, see 62 12... ..\n\nRelay (8) switches with road speeds above\n\n‘65 km/h (40 mph) — brown/red wire produces\nnegative (ground) pulses,\n\n(Checking Black Electcic Switching Valve (2)\nEngine stopped — ignition on\n\nPull off hose (11) from distributor and blow ae\ninto hose (12) from throttle housing.\n\nElectric switching valve (2) switches to aur low\nwith engaged 4th/Sth gears.", "words": [["11-7", 0.4874, 0.0364, 0.5369, 0.0602], ["Vacuum", 0.2604, 0.0642, 0.2998, 0.0747], ["Advance", 0.3038, 0.0642, 0.3443, 0.0747], ["Control", 0.3473, 0.0642, 0.3837, 0.0747], ["~", 0.3898, 0.0694, 0.3908, 0.0708], ["Since", 0.3989, 0.0642, 0.4247, 0.0747], ["1984", 0.4287, 0.0642, 0.452, 0.0747], ["Models:", 0.456, 0.0642, 0.4924, 0.0747], ["The", 0.2604, 0.08, 0.2776, 0.0906], ["vacuum", 0.2816, 0.0827, 0.318, 0.0906], ["advance", 0.322, 0.08, 0.3595, 0.0906], ["control", 0.3625, 0.08, 0.3969, 0.0906], ["on", 0.4009, 0.0827, 0.4135, 0.0906], ["the", 0.4176, 0.08, 0.4317, 0.0906], ["distributor", 0.4348, 0.08, 0.4853, 0.0906], ["3", 0.2594, 0.1005, 0.2664, 0.1071], ["operated", 0.2705, 0.0979, 0.3119, 0.1098], ["by", 0.316, 0.0979, 0.3271, 0.1098], ["an", 0.3311, 0.1005, 0.3423, 0.1071], ["alectric", 0.3453, 0.0979, 0.3797, 0.1071], ["switching", 0.3837, 0.0979, 0.4287, 0.1098], ["valve,", 0.4317, 0.0959, 0.458, 0.1071],